1. Route53 Overview – AWS Fully Managed DNS Service
⭐ Route53 म्हणजे काय?

Route53 हे Managed DNS (Domain Name System) आहे जे domain चे नाव सहज IP address मध्ये convert करते.

⭐ Route53 का वापरतात?

Domain register करण्यासाठी

Website hosting साठी DNS व्यवस्थापन

Traffic intelligent routing

Health checks

Multi-region failover

Hybrid networking (private hosted zone)

⭐ Route53 चे मुख्य components:
Component	Description
Hosted Zone	Domain साठी DNS records ची container
Record Types	A, AAAA, CNAME, TXT, Alias, MX, NS
Routing Policies	Traffic कसा route होईल
Health Checks	Endpoint online आहे का ते तपासणे
Traffic Flow	Advanced global routing
DNS Firewall	Block/Allow DNS queries
Private Hosted Zone	VPC internal-only DNS
