3. A Record & AAAA Record in Action
A Record

• Domain → IPv4 address
Example:
www.example.com → 54.221.10.24

AAAA Record

• Domain → IPv6 address

कधी काय वापरावे?

A → IPv4

AAAA → IPv6-enabled apps

4. CNAME Record in Action
CNAME म्हणजे Alias Name

One domain pointing to another domain.

Example:

api.mycloud.live → backend.example.com

लक्षात ठेव:

❌ CNAME root domain ला देऊ शकत नाही
✔ Use Alias instead

5. Alias Record vs CNAME
Alias → AWS resources साठी

Support targets:

ELB

CloudFront

API Gateway

S3 Websites

VPC Endpoints

CNAME → फक्त domain-to-domain
Feature	Alias	CNAME
Root domain allowed	✔	❌
Free	✔	❌
AWS resource support	✔	❌
