8. Parent Health Check in Route53

Parent Health Check = Multiple individual checks under one logic.

Example:

Health Check 1 → us-east-1 API

Health Check 2 → us-west-2 API

Parent → Mark Healthy if at least 1 is healthy

9. Routing Policies (ALL Types)
1️⃣ Weighted Routing Policy

Traffic percentage वर divide करा.

Example:

app1 → 70%

app2 → 30%

Used for:
✔ Gradual migration
✔ A/B testing

2️⃣ Geolocation Routing Policy

User च्या location वरून traffic route करणे.

Examples:

India → Mumbai server

US → N. Virginia server

3️⃣ Latency Based Routing

कमी latency असलेल्या region मध्ये user ला route करणे.

Best for:
✔ Global applications
✔ Performance sensitive apps

4️⃣ Failover Routing

Active-Passive setup

Example:

Primary → us-east-1

Secondary → us-west-2

Primary down? Route to Secondary

5️⃣ Multivalue Answer Routing

Route53 returns multiple healthy records
Used for simple load balancing (not ELB)

6️⃣ IP-Based Routing Policy

User च्या IP range वरून routing decision.

Example:

ISP A → Server A

ISP B → Server B

