🎯 Interview Questions and Answers (Route53)
Q1. Route53 म्हणजे काय?

Route53 is AWS’s highly available and scalable managed DNS service.

Q2. A Record आणि CNAME मध्ये फरक काय?

A → Points to IPv4

CNAME → Points to another domain

Q3. Alias Record कधी वापरावे?

AWS resources ला domain attach करायचा असताना.

Q4. Failover Routing म्हणजे काय?

Active-Passive setup, health check failure वर automatic switching.

Q5. Geolocation vs Latency routing?

Geolocation → User’s country

Latency → Lowest network latency

Q6. Private Hosted Zone म्हणजे काय?

Only VPC internal DNS resolution, not public.

Q7. Health check कसे काम करते?

It periodically monitors endpoints and marks them healthy/unhealthy.

Q8. Route53 DNS Firewall का वापरतात?

Malicious domain protection + traffic filtering.

Q9. Weighted routing कधी वापरतात?

A/B testing किंवा gradual migration.

Q10. Multivalue Answer Routing चे use?

Simple load balancing without ELB.

